## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **TTL Duration** — The proposed TTLs are:
> - Home listings: 5 minutes
> - Host dashboard properties: 2 minutes  
> - Cities dropdown: 30 minutes
>
> Are these acceptable? Or do you want shorter/longer stale windows?

> [!NOTE]
> **Search/Filter Caching** — The home page has filters (city, price, bedrooms, etc.). Each unique filter combination would be cached separately. This is good for UX but can grow large. We can set a lower TTL or limit the number of cached filter combos. Let me know what you prefer.

